    "long_instructions": "## Tryout Eligibility\r\n\r\n#### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Upload your tryout eligibility flowchart to AI. Then prompt AI with your tryout eligibility rule (using either AND or OR).\r\n\r\n2. Before accepting the code, carefully check that the outcomes match all four branches of your flowchart:\r\n\r\n   * meetsGradeRequirement = True, meetsAttendanceRequirement = True\r\n   * meetsGradeRequirement = True, meetsAttendanceRequirement = False\r\n   * meetsGradeRequirement = False, meetsAttendanceRequirement = True\r\n   * meetsGradeRequirement = False, meetsAttendanceRequirement = False\r\n\r\n3. Use AI to explain the code and fix any bugs.\r\n"
  },
